[00207] Root-and-branch reform of England's planning system, introducing zoning to replace the discretionary planning permission system, mandatory local housing targets enforceable by the Planning Inspectorate, and fast-track approval for developments meeting design codes. The changes aim to deliver 370,000 homes per year by removing the main systemic bottleneck to housebuilding.
