[00227] Converting the M62 corridor to a fully managed smart motorway with dynamic speed limits, variable messaging, and emergency refuge areas. The project reduces peak congestion by 20% and cuts accident rates through better incident detection. A faster delivery than rail projects with immediate driver benefits.
