[00238] Gender pay gap reporting has generated unprecedented transparency, employers are running their own internal equality programmes, and the direction of travel is positive even if the headline number has been slow to move. Market and reputational pressure is itself a form of enforcement.
[00239] Deforestation reduction is a multi-year project requiring stable financing. The milestones are real, but the framework recognises that climate diplomacy is a partnership, not a hostage situation. Britain holds Brazil accountable while also holding faith. That is the right balance.
