[02628] I am grateful to my honourable Friend. Postal Vote Reform is in force. Signature retakes every three years, ID match required, automatic enrolment for disabled voters, and pre-paid return envelopes. The system is more secure AND more accessible. Those are not opposites when the policy design respects both objectives.
