[02861] Every conflict has an intensity, and that number is the whole game. Britain ends a war by brokering peace between the two sides, which means bringing the intensity down until a ceasefire holds. You can watch the number on the World Relationships screen, and when it falls week on week your mediation is working.
[02862] The Daily Mail has obtained and published the unredacted donor list from your leadership campaign. Thirteen names on it also appear on the register of lobbyists currently under investigation. Your comms team is in crisis mode. The Director of the Electoral Commission has requested a meeting.
